_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5jFp61uhaeIbhaLySNsjr7HAqbv6PgbXwVML9dJnUFMA&oe=6A19B623"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 2026-04-22 182937.png", "id": "26822660627371867", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619145_26822660650705198_178178829357942133_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=15ay4DzSu4QQ7kNvwFxCorc&_nc_oc=AdqXbWkpM13JVP2EtdBwKGTrRxOCSSKwdZQC3RZnjhHT0P2FNRG0nUvhQFL9GETZSdg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5tWHS5RGaiBDRmgnf2uWROXXMofNpoeCMrKOjKGNxKww&oe=6A198A84"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Controls and Wiring", "keywords": ["control", "wiring", "vr", "immerselearn"], "long_description": "Controls and Wiring is an immersive VR training application that enables learners to develop real-world skills in electrical control systems, circuit wiring, and component integration. Through interactive simulations, users practice identifying components, interpreting wiring diagrams, assembling control circuits, and troubleshooting faults in a safe, virtual environment.\n\nThis application is a core component of the Immerse Learn Controls and Wiring micro-credential program, designed to enhance technical proficiency through experiential learning. Learners gain confidence by performing tasks that mirror real industry scenarios, improving both accuracy and decision-making skills.\n\nPlease note: This app is not a standalone product. Access is strictly limited to individuals enrolled in the Immerse Learn Controls and Wiring micro-credential program, where it is used for guided, hands-on training.", "short_description": "Controls and Wiring is a VR training application designed to build practical skills in electrical control systems and wiring. Part of the Immerse Learn Controls and Wiring micro-credential program, this app provides hands-on, immersive learning experiences. Access is exclusively available to learners enrolled in the program."}]}, "developer_name": null, 